# @chrishayuk/house is a `file:../house` dependency. Turbopack (Next 16's
# default bundler) currently refuses to resolve modules through a symlink
# that points outside the project root, which is npm's default behavior for
# local `file:` deps. install-links makes npm materialize it as a real copy
# in node_modules instead — the standard fix for this exact situation.
# Consequence: after editing ../house, re-run `npm install` here to pick up
# the change (no live pass-through like a symlink would give you).
install-links=true
